cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: Tetradrome
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, audit-first Python workbench for the computational toolset of
  smooth 4-dimensional topology: native Khovanov, Lee, Rasmussen s, and knot
  Floer homology for knots, links, and braids, behind one validated schema, with
  established tools used only as oracles.
type: software
authors:
  - name: rbraunm
repository-code: "https://github.com/rbraunm/tetradrome"
url: "https://github.com/rbraunm/tetradrome"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - low-dimensional topology
  - smooth 4-manifolds
  - knot Floer homology
  - Khovanov homology
  - Rasmussen invariant
  - slice genus
  - concordance
  - computational topology
